Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): syntax-colour the G-code viewer

Tokenizer + LayoutJob rows (G/M/T/F/S/axis words, numbers, comments, N
numbers) in theme-aware palettes; tokenization cached per program; the
displayed text is the posted line byte for byte. Left alignment was
already on main.

